, arithmetic iteration, rounding, or calculator operations into independent ProcedureModels\n- preserve both proposed formula branches in the convergence-selection questions, with ordered approved composition for the convergent route and authenticated non-exposed rejected authority for the divergent route\n- isolate 34 cross-family derivation parts as candidates, including 23 exact-evidence candidate ProcedureInstances owned by Differentiation or Integration\n- deterministically rebuild the cumulative registry, shared procedure library, KG projection, active release manifest, authenticated product readback, and API/gateway admission constants\n- replace the predecessor builder's fixed-depth I/O helper lookup with a bounded capability-based lookup so the cumulative chain remains buildable at #1730 depth\n\n## User impact and root cause\n\nBefore this change, Numerical Solution of Equations had no approved cumulative P3 semantic shard, so product readback could not expose its root-finding and iteration semantics. The cumulative builder also assumed exactly three predecessor hops to the shared canonical I/O helper; adding the next child reached the wrong module and failed before readback materialization.\n\nThis PR adds the missing reviewed semantic delta and makes helper resolution follow the authenticated predecessor chain until the canonical byte/readback capability is found. Product admission remains content-addressed and fail-closed.\n\n## Metrics\n\n- discovered/reviewed Questions: 60 / 60\n- reviewed score-owning parts: 184 = 150 approved + 34 candidate\n- approved Questions: 60; candidate/abstain/rejected Questions: 0\n- shard ProcedureInstances: 132 = 109 core + 23 supporting candidates\n- material alternative branches: 2\n- cumulative P3 Questions: 929\n- cumulative QuestionTypes: 56\n- cumulative ProcedureModels: 52\n- product readback pass rate: 100%\n- candidate exposed as approved: 0\n- structural/provider/remote writes: 0\n\n## Validation\n\n- immutable predecessor replay at `2a2c8ad845e907da000593e1f499f760b3522706` / tree `0e6a9153ac780d1668870d01a212afc9fd7f59c6`\n  - #1729 builder `--check`: PASS\n  - #1729 historical semantic suite: 8/8 PASS\n  - predecessor manifest SHA256: `a393c33f1689fe0837b7c3d84ce7ec230bed733e9ce79becbb2c3e48fa9715d8`\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1730_numerical_solution_semantic_kg.py --check`\n- #1730 focused semantic suite: 9/9 PASS\n- authenticated service/API/real-gateway suites: 69/69 PASS\n- pinned-root ESLint for the three changed JavaScript files\n- Python compilation for the predecessor fix, successor builder, and focused suite\n- `git diff --check`\n- report artifact index check: PASS\n- final AO preflight: workflow and artifact guards healthy; expected feature-branch/dirty-state warnings only before commit\n- raw-byte runtime custody: PASS\n\nActive release hashes:\n\n- manifest: `8de60616de9423238625713fec61fd99bcbe6facbcedf4e0f8715016ebb7844b`\n- nodes: `c4cdcbbf07483b7153c794b821fe54344d6c32f4738b5267a59d20fef2dee453`\n- edges: `3b0cabb06223827fc4488ba13b2e7f1cb0a4ed6ef888a58d4df9a843bf71204d`\n\nCloses #1730\n","created_at":"2026-07-28T03:40:15Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T04:20:42Z","closed_at":"2026-07-28T04:13:15Z","merged_at":"2026-07-28T04:13:14Z","merge_commit_sha":"9474b322433590329d7fd8bc187cffbd7f02abc4","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1740/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1740/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1740/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/ddc98dac279b5688481a11d0776893ac1279624a","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1730","ref":"feat/issue-1